{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415712","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415712","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041571201:1":{"text":"오, 아로라! 왜 그렇게 잠이 덜 깬 얼굴이에요?","source_cn":"呀！奥萝菈，你怎么一副没睡醒的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C2473FBC4A5792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041571202:1":{"text":"음... 굉장히... 혼란스러운 꿈을 꿨어요...","source_cn":"唔……我做了一个很……很混乱的梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20EDA2B3D743F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041571203:1":{"text":"꿈에 사막이 나왔는데, 하늘에 엄청나게 큰 고래가 날아다녔거든요...","source_cn":"我梦到了一片沙漠，沙漠的天空中飞翔着一只巨大的鲸鱼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79124BE0015E6527","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041571204:1":{"text":"아! 그럼... 그 고래가 굉장히 외로워 보였겠네요?","source_cn":"啊……那你一定会觉得它很孤单！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D4DED8E77050410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041571205:1":{"text":"네, 맞아요...","source_cn":"嗯，没错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9BBABAD0284468D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041571206:1":{"text":"“고래가 동료를 찾을 수 있으면 좋겠다”... 라고 생각했어요.","source_cn":"“要是，它能见到同伴，就好了”……我这样想了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC48412B6A56E7C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041571207:1":{"text":"그러더니 갑자기 폭우가 내려서, 사막이 거대한 바다가 되었어요.","source_cn":"然后，沙漠就下起了暴雨……水面上升，最后变成一片汪洋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF26FF825A72BDF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041571208:1":{"text":"마치... 쓰나미가 몰아치는 것 같았죠.","source_cn":"简直就像……经历了一场海啸……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B69D90FDB607404","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041571209:1":{"text":"타시, 꿈속의 사막에서 당신을 본 것 같아요... 혹시 바닷물에 삼켜지지는 않았죠?","source_cn":"塔西，我好像在梦里的沙漠见过你……你没有被海水吞没吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150A49CFB6CDF3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041571210:1":{"text":"아... 저, 저는 괜찮아요!","source_cn":"哦……我、我一点事也没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA23F65C0D07B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041571211:1":{"text":"저는 꿈의 요정이니까요. 꿈속에서 다칠 리 없잖아요...?!","source_cn":"我可是梦境妖精，怎么会在梦里受伤呢……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37718CCAEDF112F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041571212:1":{"text":"음, 그럼 다행이네요...","source_cn":"嗯，那就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D5F16111AFA4CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041571213:1":{"text":"저... 좀 더 자야 할 거 같아요. 너무 피곤하네요...","source_cn":"我……我觉得我需要再睡一觉，感觉很累……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57D76E129E95678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041571214:1":{"text":"그럼요, 그럼요! 좀 더 쉬어요. 그럼 저도...","source_cn":"没错没错，你还是再休息一会吧！我也要去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29DB944329B29AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041571215:0":{"text":"<shk>...타시! 여기 있었구나!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——塔西！你竟然在这里！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B3CA9A635D524B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041571216:0":{"text":"이 심술쟁이 나비, 아로라의 꿈을 엉망으로 만들다니! 쓰나미 때문에 사흘 내내 물속에서 헤맸단 말이야!","source_cn":"你这坏心眼的小蝴蝶！竟然把奥萝菈的梦搅得一塌糊涂！那海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5DA485C1CF83F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041571217:1":{"text":"...어라, 타시가 한 일이었나요?","source_cn":"……咦？是塔西做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41E1F47D8D4359C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041571218:1":{"text":"이, 일부러 한 건 아니었어요! 고래가 동료를 만났으면 좋겠다고 생각했잖아요? 그래서 조금 도와준...!","source_cn":"我、我不是故意的！奥萝菈想让鲸鱼见见同伴，我只是想帮个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE43E6A1C2FEB6FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041571219:0":{"text":"세상에! 다시는 돕지 마. 네가 그렇게 만들어낸 건 악마보다도 더 무섭다고!","source_cn":"哦，天哪！你可别再帮忙了，你哄她变出来的东西简直比恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC6695FDA3F3673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041571220:0":{"text":"이제부터 아로라의 꿈에 들어가는 건 금지야. 금지!","source_cn":"我要禁止你进入奥萝菈的梦境——禁止！禁止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF7290BA35A88E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔西":{"text":"타시","source":"塔西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"아로라","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:桑尼":{"text":"새니","source":"桑尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}